## Appendix


Fields and options available to` queryTraces()` :


- **Combine conditions** :` and` ,` or` ,` not`
- **Trace** :` traceId` ,` threadId` ,` resourceId` ,` runId` ,` sessionId` ,` userId` ,` organizationId` ,` entityName` ,` entityType` ,` environment` ,` status` ,` startedAt` ,` endedAt` ,` durationMs` ,` tags` ,` metadata.<key>`
- **Spans** (` spans.some` ,` spans.none` ):` name` ,` spanType` ,` model` ,` provider` ,` status` ,` error` ,` startedAt` ,` endedAt` ,` durationMs` ,` entityType` ,` entityId` ,` entityName` ,` entityVersionId` ,` parentEntityVersionId` ,` rootEntityVersionId` ,` runId` ,` sessionId` ,` userId` ,` organizationId`
- **Scores** (` scores.some` ,` scores.none` ):` scorerId` ,` scorerVersion` ,` scoreSource` ,` score` ,` timestamp` ,` spanId` ,` entityVersionId` ,` parentEntityVersionId` ,` rootEntityVersionId`
- **Feedback** (` feedback.some` ,` feedback.none` ):` feedbackType` ,` feedbackSource` ,` feedbackUserId` ,` sourceId` ,` value` ,` timestamp` ,` comment` ,` entityVersionId` ,` parentEntityVersionId` ,` rootEntityVersionId`
- **Operators** :` eq` ,` ne` ,` in` ,` notIn` ,` lt` ,` lte` ,` gt` ,` gte` ,` exists` ,` notExists` ,` includes` ,` notIncludes` (tags),` matches` ,` notMatches` (span` name` , feedback` comment` )
- **Pagination** :` page: { limit, after }` ,` pagination: { page, perPage }` ,` mode: 'delta'`
- **Discovery** :` getTraceQueryFields()` ,` getTraceQueryValues()`
